SUMMARY:Chestnut picking
LOCATION:Gare du Nord
URL:https://www.billetweb.fr/chestnut-picking
DESCRIPTION:Venue: Gare du Nord\nHello guys ! ???? On the 17th of October 2
 026 we are going to the forest to pick some nice chestnuts ???? Luckily fo
 r you guys\, I am an expert ahah ???? You will know everything about them\
 , where and when to find them\, how to tell them appart from their cousin 
 the horse chestnut\, which is not edible. How to preserve\, prepare & cook
  them ???? And many other things you would not expect about this amazing f
 ruit ! Meeting point is at 2:00 pm at Gare du nord ???? Don't be late ! Th
 e train leaves at 2:26pm. Otherwise if you are not coming from Paris\, you
  can join us directly at Gare Vaucelles at 3:00 pm You need at least a tot
 e bag ????️ or a backpack ???? to bring them back home. I advise you to 
 take suitable clothes and shoes ???? Gardener gloves ???? or similar are h
 ighly recommended to avoid being pricked by the chestnut burrs ! ???? A sm
 all water bottle is nice to have too. ESN card is mandatory to participate
  ! You can get it here: https://crmdev.esn.paris/esncardpage\n\nhttps://ww
 w.billetweb.fr/chestnut-picking
END:VEVENT
