DESCRIPTION:Venue: 53 Rue Notre Dame des Champs\, 75006 Paris\n????✨ Movi
 e Night with Erasmus Paris x Lost in Frenchlation! ✨???? Do you love fil
 ms? Then come and join us for a special screening of a true French comedy 
 classic: ???? Astérix & Obélix: Mission Cléopâtre ????????✨ Plot The
  Egyptian Queen Cleopatra bets against the Roman Emperor\, Julius Caesar\,
  that her people are still great\, even if the times of the Pharaohs has l
 ong passed. She vows (against all logic) to build a new palace for Caesar 
 within three months. Since all her architects are either busy otherwise or
  too conservative in style\, this ambivalent honor falls to Edifis. He is 
 to build the palace and be covered in gold or\, if not\, his fate is to be
  eaten by crocodiles. ???? Don’t miss this chance to discover a French c
 lassic with English subtitles\, meet new people ????\, and share a magical
  evening together! ???? Tuesday\, October 27 ???? 7:00 PM ????Lucernaire :
  53 Rue Notre Dame des Champs\, 75006 Paris ???? 7 €\n\nhttps://www.bill
 etweb.fr/lost-in-frenchslation-mission-cleopatre
